<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18713] Compute &quot;withXXX&quot; modifiers are not applied if they came before withExecutor modifier.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18713</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18545&quot; title=&quot;Compute &amp;quot;withXXX&amp;quot; modifiers in some cases are not applied to the user compute method call.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-18545&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-18545&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; the following code &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
IgniteCompute compute = grid(0).compute().withTimeout(1000).withExecutor(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;executor&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).execute(&amp;lt;task&amp;gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;will result in task execution without timeout modifier applied.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
